- op: discuss  # 09a3
  at: '2026-11-12T20:45:37Z'  # 09a3
  by: agent  # 09a3
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 09a3
  clock: 3  # 09a3
  nonce: 09a3  # 09a3
  message: "Fixed in PR #2154 (merged). classify() takes directives from COMMENT tokens keyed to scope + the code on their line; the stored per-test-file digest keeps its formula so read records stay valid. Behavioral evidence: classify() on a pragma moved to another line now returns code (was comments); rewording a docstring line quoting a pragma returns docstrings (was code); test_prose_only.py pins both plus a scope-distinct identical line, a standalone directive and a header above a module docstring. Old/new agree on all 752 changed .py pairs in the last 400 commits. Same PR: tokenize rowed and granted (the new import tripped check-claims-coverage), and the probe over all 139 granted python modules rowed 10 unrowed I/O functions (ast/uuid/gzip/tarfile/zipfile/cProfile main, ctypes.util.test, doctest.debug_script, tarfile.is_tarfile, zipfile.is_zipfile)."  # 09a3
